{"3747890": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BAROQUE SYNDROME", "steam_appid": 3747890, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a ported version of Baroque Syndrome, a visual novel of hallucination and delusion originally released in 2000, based on BAROQUISM▲SYNDROME—a novel depicting the “pre-Baroque history” of the world of Baroque, before the Great Heatwave occurred.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Game Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Kitsune, the protagonist, who runs a new kind of business called the “Baroque Shop,” healing people who have been consumed by distorted delusions known as “Baroques” by creating the fantasies they desire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a branching, surreal, dark visual novel in which the story changes depending on the choices you make throughout your progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you move forward, various decisions will appear, and the direction of the scenario shifts according to your selections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In other words, the outcome of the story is entirely in your hands—the hands of the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fonts, CG stills, animations, and various other elements have been remastered, with parts of the UI updated for Steam.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save slots expanded to 20, allowing you to preserve your favorite scenes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toggle between skip-read, skip-all, and auto-play modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A log function lets you review any lines you may have missed.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a ported version of Baroque Syndrome, a visual novel of hallucination and delusion originally released in 2000, based on BAROQUISM▲SYNDROME—a novel depicting the “pre-Baroque history” of the world of Baroque, before the Great Heatwave occurred.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Game Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Kitsune, the protagonist, who runs a new kind of business called the “Baroque Shop,” healing people who have been consumed by distorted delusions known as “Baroques” by creating the fantasies they desire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a branching, surreal, dark visual novel in which the story changes depending on the choices you make throughout your progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you move forward, various decisions will appear, and the direction of the scenario shifts according to your selections.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In other words, the outcome of the story is entirely in your hands—the hands of the player.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fonts, CG stills, animations, and various other elements have been remastered, with parts of the UI updated for Steam.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save slots expanded to 20, allowing you to preserve your favorite scenes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toggle between skip-read, skip-all, and auto-play modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A log function lets you review any lines you may have missed.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "This ported edition of Baroque Syndrome presents the visual novel depicting the events before the main Baroque story. Play as Kitsune, owner of the Baroque Shop, and experience a branching narrative shaped by your choices. Fonts, stills, animations, and UI have been remastered for smoother play.", "supported_languages": "Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747890/1e379ef7c2e11d2de0b8656170fbf1180779c3a2/header.jpg?t=1770529405", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/ste